[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0905:b008:l012","ordinal":146177,"en":"The wicked Adybai and Kolbai were there;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0905:b008:l013","ordinal":146178,"en":"Their villainy kept increasing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0905:b008:l014","ordinal":146179,"en":"Such were these wicked men."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0905:b008:l015","ordinal":146180,"en":"Raging and blustering,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0905:b008:l016","ordinal":146181,"en":"Like men possessed by an evil spirit,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0905:b008:l017","ordinal":146182,"en":"Rousing their courage, stamping,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0905:b008:l018","ordinal":146183,"en":"Growing eager and defiant,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0905:b008:l019","ordinal":146184,"en":"That daughter-cursing Kochkor began:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0905:b008:l020","ordinal":146185,"en":"\"Damn you, forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0905:b008:l021","ordinal":146186,"en":"All forty of you were red lions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0905:b008:l022","ordinal":146187,"en":"Compared with reckless Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l001","ordinal":146188,"en":"In what way were you his inferiors?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l002","ordinal":146189,"en":"You brought slaughter upon the world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l003","ordinal":146190,"en":"And Manas took the credit for the deeds."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l004","ordinal":146191,"en":"When a hero was speared, you speared him;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l005","ordinal":146192,"en":"Damn you, forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l006","ordinal":146193,"en":"The fame remained with Manas!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l007","ordinal":146194,"en":"Manas was no greater hero than you;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l008","ordinal":146195,"en":"The valor of the forty companions"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l009","ordinal":146196,"en":"Khan Manas was indeed a khan;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l010","ordinal":146197,"en":"Damn you, forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l011","ordinal":146198,"en":"Drink stones instead of spirits!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l012","ordinal":146199,"en":"Rather than become a boy's companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l013","ordinal":146200,"en":"Drink your fathers' blood as well!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l014","ordinal":146201,"en":"The valor of the forty companions—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l015","ordinal":146202,"en":"Can humankind equal it?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l016","ordinal":146203,"en":"Will you forty companions spend"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l017","ordinal":146204,"en":"Your whole lives as companions?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l018","ordinal":146205,"en":"With your ardor roused, forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l019","ordinal":146206,"en":"Finding no mountain to hurl yourselves against,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l020","ordinal":146207,"en":"Finding no foe to fight,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l021","ordinal":146208,"en":"All forty were khans of forty clans,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l022","ordinal":146209,"en":"All forty were precious lions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l023","ordinal":146210,"en":"All forty were wolves from forty places,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l025","ordinal":146211,"en":"Your battle cries split stone;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l026","ordinal":146212,"en":"All forty came to Talas from forty places."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l028","ordinal":146213,"en":"His eyes bound by night travel,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l029","ordinal":146214,"en":"You became Manas's companions."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l030","ordinal":146215,"en":"Going back to Keng-Kol,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l031","ordinal":146216,"en":"You mean to settle there, it seems;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l032","ordinal":146217,"en":"To Manas's only son"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l033","ordinal":146218,"en":"You mean to return and gather,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l034","ordinal":146219,"en":"And serve him, it seems."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l035","ordinal":146220,"en":"In the foremost rank of foolishness,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l036","ordinal":146221,"en":"Who could match you forty companions?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l037","ordinal":146222,"en":"From father to son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l038","ordinal":146223,"en":"Will your lives pass entirely in service?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b003:l039","ordinal":146224,"en":"Will the forty companions, their strength gone,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l001","ordinal":146225,"en":"Go scouting again?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l002","ordinal":146226,"en":"Manas's orphan, who came wandering back—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l003","ordinal":146227,"en":"Will you make him your lord?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l004","ordinal":146228,"en":"Better that you had never been born!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l005","ordinal":146229,"en":"Damn you, forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l006","ordinal":146230,"en":"Better die than see this!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l007","ordinal":146231,"en":"Manas's orphan son—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l008","ordinal":146232,"en":"See his great oppression:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l009","ordinal":146233,"en":"He catches and slaughters your colts."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l010","ordinal":146234,"en":"If you make that orphan your lord,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l011","ordinal":146235,"en":"He will drain much of your strength."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l012","ordinal":146236,"en":"Where could that orphan slave have found it?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l013","ordinal":146237,"en":"He will ruin your well-being."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l014","ordinal":146238,"en":"Damn you, forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l015","ordinal":146239,"en":"Will the boy understand and value"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l016","ordinal":146240,"en":"Your royal dignity?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l017","ordinal":146241,"en":"When you incur Semetey's wrath,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l018","ordinal":146242,"en":"He will dig your pit deep,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l019","ordinal":146243,"en":"He will bring misery upon you."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l020","ordinal":146244,"en":"If you become the orphan's companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l021","ordinal":146245,"en":"Damn you, forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l022","ordinal":146246,"en":"You will see some fine wonders!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l023","ordinal":146247,"en":"In a place with high, sheer cliffs,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l024","ordinal":146248,"en":"His mother is a scheming bitch."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l025","ordinal":146249,"en":"You have your dignitaries and elders,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l026","ordinal":146250,"en":"Damn you, forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l027","ordinal":146251,"en":"Unless slaughter strikes them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l028","ordinal":146252,"en":"They are all still there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l029","ordinal":146253,"en":"As a wife, she disrupted the people;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l030","ordinal":146254,"en":"When his mother was a girl,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l031","ordinal":146255,"en":"She shook the world and disrupted the people."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l032","ordinal":146256,"en":"In the city of mighty Bukhara,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l033","ordinal":146257,"en":"In Temir Khan's settlement,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l034","ordinal":146258,"en":"His wretched mother Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l035","ordinal":146259,"en":"A playful little child,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l036","ordinal":146260,"en":"Her hair not yet long enough to braid,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l037","ordinal":146261,"en":"Not yet past fourteen years,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l038","ordinal":146262,"en":"Bakai and Koshoi, the two giants,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0906:b004:l039","ordinal":146263,"en":"Calling her 'a lion among women,'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l001","ordinal":146264,"en":"When those two had judged her,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l002","ordinal":146265,"en":"Saying, 'I shall have her bear a lion,'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l003","ordinal":146266,"en":"Reckless Khan Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l004","ordinal":146267,"en":"Loaded eighty camels with gold coins,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l005","ordinal":146268,"en":"And went to arrange the marriage."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l006","ordinal":146269,"en":"According to Muslim custom,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l007","ordinal":146270,"en":"Temir Khan, the khan of Bukhara,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l008","ordinal":146271,"en":"Saying, 'I shall give her to this Manas,'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l009","ordinal":146272,"en":"Gathered khojas and mullahs,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l010","ordinal":146273,"en":"And performed the marriage at noon."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l011","ordinal":146274,"en":"According to the ancient custom,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l012","ordinal":146275,"en":"Into the arms of hulking Lord Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l013","ordinal":146276,"en":"To place the girl,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l014","ordinal":146277,"en":"And receive the sisters-in-law's gift,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l015","ordinal":146278,"en":"Ninety young wives and ninety girls,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l016","ordinal":146279,"en":"Saying, 'We shall lay her beside Manas,'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l017","ordinal":146280,"en":"Brought her there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l018","ordinal":146281,"en":"She refused to lie with him then,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l019","ordinal":146282,"en":"And the whole people bore the uproar."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l020","ordinal":146283,"en":"Kanykei drew her dagger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l021","ordinal":146284,"en":"And then stabbed through"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l022","ordinal":146285,"en":"Khan Manas's forearm."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l023","ordinal":146286,"en":"That bitch who stabbed Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l024","ordinal":146287,"en":"Now urging on her son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l025","ordinal":146288,"en":"Will she leave us alive?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l026","ordinal":146289,"en":"There is much to tell of her;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l027","ordinal":146290,"en":"This bitch has an unhealed grudge."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l028","ordinal":146291,"en":"When Manas died,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l029","ordinal":146292,"en":"Before forty days had passed since his death,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l030","ordinal":146293,"en":"You found a wicked way to deal with her,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l031","ordinal":146294,"en":"Damn you, forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l032","ordinal":146295,"en":"You slashed her breast!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l033","ordinal":146296,"en":"The villains Chyibyt and Kochkor,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l034","ordinal":146297,"en":"The wicked men who would not heed words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l035","ordinal":146298,"en":"The ignorant men whom God Almighty"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l036","ordinal":146299,"en":"Had steeped in wickedness—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l037","ordinal":146300,"en":"Khan Manas's forty companions"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l038","ordinal":146301,"en":"Believed what they said."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b003:l039","ordinal":146302,"en":"When the sun sank slowly,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l001","ordinal":146303,"en":"When the first people lay down,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l002","ordinal":146304,"en":"Unseen by a single person,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l003","ordinal":146305,"en":"Unknown to anyone,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l004","ordinal":146306,"en":"Leaving their abundant wealth scattered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l005","ordinal":146307,"en":"All the forty companions"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l006","ordinal":146308,"en":"Now fled from Talas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l007","ordinal":146309,"en":"They crossed Ashmara,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l008","ordinal":146310,"en":"Traveled through Keng-Ozon."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l009","ordinal":146311,"en":"'Why should we stay here?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l010","ordinal":146312,"en":"To Kongurbai of the Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l011","ordinal":146313,"en":"Let us flee,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l012","ordinal":146314,"en":"And become his companions."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l013","ordinal":146315,"en":"That daughter-cursed orphan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l014","ordinal":146316,"en":"Let us bring him to his end this way."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l015","ordinal":146317,"en":"Let us plunder his precious cloth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l016","ordinal":146318,"en":"Then bring disorder."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l017","ordinal":146319,"en":"Against that impetuous orphan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l018","ordinal":146320,"en":"I shall avenge myself for all the past."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l019","ordinal":146321,"en":"Taking the road along Keng-Ozon,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l020","ordinal":146322,"en":"They traveled a considerable way."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l021","ordinal":146323,"en":"On the banks of the broad Ili,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l022","ordinal":146324,"en":"They reached Kyzyl-Jiyde."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l023","ordinal":146325,"en":"Spreading out their food,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l024","ordinal":146326,"en":"Each man set his own small kettle"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l025","ordinal":146327,"en":"To boil on the open plain."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l026","ordinal":146328,"en":"They stopped for a long while,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l027","ordinal":146329,"en":"And all their riding animals"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l028","ordinal":146330,"en":"They tethered."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l029","ordinal":146331,"en":"All the choice noble steeds,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l030","ordinal":146332,"en":"The forty companions then"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l031","ordinal":146333,"en":"Unsaddled and left bare-backed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l032","ordinal":146334,"en":"Fastening hobbles upon their legs."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l033","ordinal":146335,"en":"Eating the horses' yearling fillies,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l034","ordinal":146336,"en":"Eating the goats' congealed fat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l035","ordinal":146337,"en":"The forty companions lay reveling."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l036","ordinal":146338,"en":"When the bright dawn broke,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l037","ordinal":146339,"en":"When light fell upon the earth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l038","ordinal":146340,"en":"Waking with a start from sleep,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0907:b005:l039","ordinal":146341,"en":"Semetey, son of Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l001","ordinal":146342,"en":"His sleep scattered away,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l002","ordinal":146343,"en":"His eyes opened wide,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l003","ordinal":146344,"en":"Big heart flutters,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l004","ordinal":146345,"en":"His entire body"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l005","ordinal":146346,"en":"Trembled visibly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l006","ordinal":146347,"en":"With leather sweatcloth and blue saddlecloth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l007","ordinal":146348,"en":"He saddled the Buurul horse."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l008","ordinal":146349,"en":"Your seething orphan"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l009","ordinal":146350,"en":"Was alarmed about the forty companions."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l010","ordinal":146351,"en":"Distressed within himself,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l011","ordinal":146352,"en":"He put on his bulletproof coat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l012","ordinal":146353,"en":"Fastened his gray belt-pouch,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l013","ordinal":146354,"en":"Pleaded with the Creator,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l014","ordinal":146355,"en":"Put on his bulletproof coat."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l015","ordinal":146356,"en":"Any twist"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l016","ordinal":146357,"en":"Without stepping into the gold-bottomed stirrup,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l017","ordinal":146358,"en":"Your orphan sprang up,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l018","ordinal":146359,"en":"Leaping like a sheep, he mounted."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l019","ordinal":146360,"en":"Calling them 'my father's inheritance,'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l020","ordinal":146361,"en":"To the forty companions themselves"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l021","ordinal":146362,"en":"He had allotted a great court,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l022","ordinal":146363,"en":"An immeasurably vast court,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l023","ordinal":146364,"en":"Where no servant went without ablution."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l024","ordinal":146365,"en":"The forty companions themselves—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l025","ordinal":146366,"en":"No one who challenged them remained alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l026","ordinal":146367,"en":"No one went there without permission,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l027","ordinal":146368,"en":"Without meeting some calamity,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l028","ordinal":146369,"en":"No one who encountered them escaped unharmed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l029","ordinal":146370,"en":"The great court of the forty companions—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l030","ordinal":146371,"en":"When he came to that great court,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l031","ordinal":146372,"en":"When he looked at the court,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l032","ordinal":146373,"en":"Wrist off the handle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l033","ordinal":146374,"en":"When he looked for the forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l034","ordinal":146375,"en":"They had scattered in every direction."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l035","ordinal":146376,"en":"Their campsite remained, but they were gone;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l036","ordinal":146377,"en":"Such was this shitty world!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l037","ordinal":146378,"en":"The pass of Ashmara—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l038","ordinal":146379,"en":"They seemed to have crossed it;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b003:l039","ordinal":146380,"en":"Along Keng-Ozon, the forty companions"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l001","ordinal":146381,"en":"Seemed to have fled."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l002","ordinal":146382,"en":"Renouncing their wealth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l003","ordinal":146383,"en":"They seemed to have scattered it."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l004","ordinal":146384,"en":"Semetey, son of Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l005","ordinal":146385,"en":"As though his father, leopard Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l006","ordinal":146386,"en":"Had only just departed this world:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l007","ordinal":146387,"en":"'My lion father, do not die!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l008","ordinal":146388,"en":"May no one be left fatherless!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l009","ordinal":146389,"en":"Such humiliation as this,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l010","ordinal":146390,"en":"If God creates a living soul,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l011","ordinal":146391,"en":"May He never inflict it on His servant!'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l012","ordinal":146392,"en":"God's sun grew overcast in the sky;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l013","ordinal":146393,"en":"Upon Semetey's head"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l014","ordinal":146394,"en":"Sixty cares came all at once."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l015","ordinal":146395,"en":"Raging and rumbling,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l016","ordinal":146396,"en":"His heart burned with grief."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l017","ordinal":146397,"en":"The young lord rode out,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l018","ordinal":146398,"en":"His dear saker-falcon eyes"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l019","ordinal":146399,"en":"Shedding tears without a blink."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l020","ordinal":146400,"en":"Too many cares for his heart to hold,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l021","ordinal":146401,"en":"His tears flowed in ten directions."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l022","ordinal":146402,"en":"That orphan of Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l023","ordinal":146403,"en":"Rode Buurul, making him plunge,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l024","ordinal":146404,"en":"Making him lunge like a widow in grief."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l025","ordinal":146405,"en":"When he let Buurul's mouth go,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l026","ordinal":146406,"en":"The horse raced the flying birds."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l027","ordinal":146407,"en":"When Semetey checked his mouth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l028","ordinal":146408,"en":"The white reins braided in okoro fashion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l029","ordinal":146409,"en":"He braced both hands upon the reins."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l030","ordinal":146410,"en":"He made him plunge beyond measure,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l031","ordinal":146411,"en":"And without end he wrestled"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l032","ordinal":146412,"en":"With the swift steed's mouth."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l033","ordinal":146413,"en":"When they came to broken ground,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l034","ordinal":146414,"en":"He twisted his neck like a stag."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l035","ordinal":146415,"en":"Ditches a target's height deep,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l036","ordinal":146416,"en":"He leaped without hesitation."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l037","ordinal":146417,"en":"When they came to hilly ground,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l038","ordinal":146418,"en":"He sped like a mirage."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0908:b004:l039","ordinal":146419,"en":"Clods as big as a great cauldron,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0909:b003:l001","ordinal":146420,"en":"Flew whistling over his head."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0909:b003:l002","ordinal":146421,"en":"Laying back his ears like a wild ass,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0909:b003:l003","ordinal":146422,"en":"Semetey's Buurul"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0909:b003:l004","ordinal":146423,"en":"Scattered the earth like a whirlwind."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0909:b003:l005","ordinal":146424,"en":"Visible wherever he could be seen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0909:b003:l006","ordinal":146425,"en":"And when Buurul disappeared,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0909:b003:l007","ordinal":146426,"en":"He vanished like blue smoke."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0909:b003:l008","ordinal":146427,"en":"The ground spun past beneath his clattering hooves;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0909:b003:l009","ordinal":146428,"en":"When Buurul's mouth was given freedom,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0909:b003:l010","ordinal":146429,"en":"He flew onward like a mirage."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0909:b003:l011","ordinal":146430,"en":"Following their trail without respite,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0909:b003:l012","ordinal":146431,"en":"He pursued them relentlessly,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0909:b003:l013","ordinal":146432,"en":"Following the horses' tracks,"}]
